WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:02.935
Excuse me.

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:04.103
Oh, excuse me, sir.

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:05.805
Are you
sitting in 26G?

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:06.873
Yes.

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.041
Have I done
something wrong?

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:09.442
No, no, no, no,
we just wanted to ask

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:10.777
if you would mind
switching seats

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.979
so that a mother and a child
could sit together.

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:16.482
But I'm back there.

00:00:16.515 --> 00:00:18.518
Right, yeah, but you'd
actually be sitting here...

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:21.387
[gentle harp flourish]

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.723
Which is
in Economy Plus.

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:25.591
It's actually
an upgrade.

00:00:25.624 --> 00:00:26.692
Upgrade, you say.

00:00:26.725 --> 00:00:28.694
Mm-hmm.

00:00:28.727 --> 00:00:30.363
Economy Plus.

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:31.464
Yes, sir.

00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:33.599
Oh.

00:00:33.632 --> 00:00:34.967
Don't mind
if I do.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.736
Great, great.
Carry-on?

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:39.539
Carry on
yourself, Alex.

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:41.007
Thank you.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.376
[classical music]

00:00:43.409 --> 00:00:45.244
Economy Plus.

00:00:45.277 --> 00:00:47.447
Mm, for the discerning
passenger.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.981
[chuckles]

00:00:49.014 --> 00:00:50.016
[chuckles]

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:54.787
We're not
in Kansas anymore, Toto.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.789
(man over PA)
Ladies and gentlemen,
this is your captain speaking.

00:00:56.822 --> 00:00:59.692
We should be leaving Topeka
in the next ten minutes.

00:00:59.725 --> 00:01:01.194
I stand corrected.

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:03.296
Looks like we're gonna have
a smooth flight.

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:04.831
Trust me,
I know the captain,

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:07.133
and he is, uh,
one smooth guy.

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:09.436
- [scoffs]
- [chuckles]

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:16.309
[laughing]

00:01:20.379 --> 00:01:22.949
Of course
he knows the captain.

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:24.517
He is the captain.

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:28.221
Oh-ho-ho!
Ho! Oh!

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:30.323
Move over,
Colin Mochrie.

00:01:30.356 --> 00:01:32.925
There's a new face
in the biz.

00:01:32.958 --> 00:01:34.827
His name is Captain.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.864
[laughing]

00:01:39.465 --> 00:01:42.635
Have to be in Economy Plus
to get it, I guess.

00:01:42.668 --> 00:01:44.204
[sighs]

00:01:47.606 --> 00:01:50.176
Extra foot room.

00:01:50.209 --> 00:01:52.778
One inch at least.

00:01:52.811 --> 00:01:54.447
Mm.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:00.586
<i> Sky Shoppe</i> magazine.

00:02:00.619 --> 00:02:01.821
[chuckles]

00:02:01.854 --> 00:02:04.057
Don't mind if I do.

00:02:05.357 --> 00:02:10.129
Oh, dog-eared
for my convenience.

00:02:10.162 --> 00:02:13.666
<i> Lord of the Rings</i> cups.

00:02:13.699 --> 00:02:16.536
<i> Lord of the Rings</i> tables.

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:18.037
Oh. Oh!

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:21.874
Oh!
Holy shiatsu massage!

00:02:21.907 --> 00:02:24.177
[laughs]
Economy Plus!

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:29.015
It hurts a little,
but--but I like it.

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:31.885
[crying]

00:02:32.918 --> 00:02:34.220
Wrong spot.

00:02:34.253 --> 00:02:37.223
[snoring]

00:02:37.256 --> 00:02:40.260
[airplane rattling]

00:02:42.094 --> 00:02:45.098
[thunder rumbling]

00:02:57.176 --> 00:03:00.112
[thunder booms]

00:03:00.145 --> 00:03:03.416
[suspenseful music]

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:05.418
[thunder booms]

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:12.258
♪ ♪

00:03:12.291 --> 00:03:13.659
Hmm.

00:03:13.692 --> 00:03:15.795
And I thought
I had an upgrade.

